				"2E8BFA2E719B1C47"
			]
			description: [
				"Great for automatically converting between Nuggets, Ingots, and Blocks of metals, or simply storing massive amounts of things. Also works with &9Monicoins&r."
				""
				"The appearance can be customized by crafting the drawer into a &aFramed Compacting Drawer&r and then using a &9Framing Template&r or your crafting grid."
