		{
			dependencies: [
				"47094A5717952699"
				"273F3F8DD6A3DCC5"
				"134AD7825E3324B4"
				"68897FC5F720BB4F"
			]
			description: [
				"This pack has &aSnad&r, which is simply a sand-like block that instantly grows sugar cane/cactus on top of it when it receives either a block update or a redstone update."
				""
				"The sugar cane it produces can be used as fuel for your dynamos, and later you can even brew &9Biomass&r with it."
				""
				"This quest calls for a &aRedstone Clock&r because it grows Snad even on the fastest setting - vanilla Observer clocks pulse too quickly."
				""
				"To harvest the sugar cane, you can use a piston and an observer."
				""
				"For now, a &3Vacuum Chest&r should help keep the floor clean, and will cause less lag than Hoppers. A &aVoid Upgrade&r in a &6Storage Drawer&r will automatically delete any items that overflow the drawer's capacity, so it's a good way to ensure you don't crash your server from accumulating a massive sugar cane pile."
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			icon: "snad:snad"
			id: "63ADD9B48834AA39"
			optional: true
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Yes, Snad."
