		{
			dependencies: ["3BD20358F137E7C6"]
			description: [
				"The main purpose for this device is to turn &6Certus Quartz&r into &6Charged Certus Quartz&r."
				""
				"This device can be powered with RF via energy cards or AE energy from a network via cables."
				""
				"It accepts power from &9five&r sides. Which &9five&r sides? It's pretty easy to guess."
				""
				"You can also easily automate charging by having hoppers input items from the top or sides, and pull items from the bottom."
