			description: [
				"A &aSoft Mallet&f can be used to temporarily stop a machine from functioning. While &9this can also be done by pressing the pause button within the machine's GUI&r, the Soft Mallet allows you to quickly turn machines on and off without entering their GUI. &2In either case, please note that the machine will only stop after it finishes its current recipe.&r This can be helpful if you are low on power, but is mostly useful when you need to upgrade a multiblock (more on those later)."
