		{
			dependencies: ["604CCBE824D03A74"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"&bGregTech&r adds a very versatile way of augmenting machines with &aMachine Covers&r. Covers are \"upgrades\" that you can put on any &eGregTech machine, crate, or drum&r to expand its functionality. These are separate on each side of the machine, meaning you can have up to six different covers! &9Covers can be edited and removed via the given machine's GUI&r, but for the others, you'll need to make yourself a &aScrewdriver&r to configure covers, and a &aCrowbar&r to remove covers without having to break the machine."
				""
				"Here's a list of some covers there are in the game, and what they do:"
				""
				"- &lConveyor&r: transfers items continuously to or from an adjacent inventory; is capable of round robin."
				""
				"- &lPump&r: is much like a &aConveyor&f, but for fluids."
				""
				"- &lRobotic Arm&r: is much like a &aConveyor&r, but has two additional modes:"
				"    * &eKeep Exact&r: moves items to keep a stock of at most the specified number of items"
				"    * &eSupply Exact&r: transfers precisely the specified number of items per operation."
				"This cover is very useful for crafting automation."
				""
				"- &lFluid Regulator&r: is like a &aRobotic Arm&r, but works with fluids instead of items."
				""
				"- &lShutter&r: prevents automation from interacting with a specific side of a machine."
				""
				"- &lDetector&r: Available in Item, Fluid, Energy and Activity flavors, with each having an advanced version for more precise monitoring. Emits a Redstone signal depending on the status of whatever it's detecting."
				""
				"- &lMachine Controller&r: Allows the enabling/disabling of machines or covers. Can also remove the ability of machines to pause themselves when out of power."
				""
				"Covers that move items or fluids can have a &aFilter&r placed inside them. These modify the functionality of covers in ways explained in their own quests."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:shutter_module_cover"
			id: "1A427A8CB43C8B59"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
			tasks: [
				{
					icon: "gtceu:lv_conveyor_module"
					id: "306DF07EDDE30066"
					item: {
						Count: 1
